    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR refines the repository’s migration to `mise` by making `bin/` wrappers self-sufficient (ensuring `mise` is discoverable), moving Python/npm dependency installs to shared XDG-keyed locations to avoid re-installing per worktree, and improving `bin/doctor`/setup messaging and git hook validation.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Source a shared `bin/.mise.sh` from `bin/` wrappers so `mise` is on `PATH` even without shell activation.\n- Add shared, hash-keyed installers `bin/.venv-deps` and `bin/.npm-deps` and wire them into `bin/setup` and git hooks.\n- Update `bin/doctor` to use wrappers, validate Python/node shared-link state, and detect stale git hooks.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 1 out of 27 changed files in this pull request and generated 6 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| bin/uv | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/udb-gen | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/udb | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/setup | Show install locations, tweak mise install, and switch Python/npm setup to shared installers. |\r\n| bin/ruby | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/reuse | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/regress | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/rdbg | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/rake | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/python | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/prek | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/npx | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/npm | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/node | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/make | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/install_hooks | Update post-merge/post-checkout hooks to call shared dependency installers. |\r\n| bin/idlc | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/gem | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/doctor | Use wrappers, add Python ecosystem checks, improve hook validation, and adjust toolchain failure behavior. |\r\n| bin/cmake | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/bundle | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/bash | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/asciidoctor | Source `bin/.mise.sh` before running `mise exec`. |\r\n| bin/.venv-deps | New: shared, lock-hash keyed `uv sync` + `.venv` symlink management. |\r\n| bin/.npm-deps | New: shared, lock-hash keyed `npm ci` + `node_modules` symlink management. |\r\n| bin/.mise.sh | New: helper sourced by wrappers to locate `mise` on PATH. |\r\n| .mise.toml | Set `BUNDLE_PATH` under XDG data to share gems across worktrees. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv/riscv-unified-db/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
